    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2E4x5Wwfdj9qAkWfgGsyuT2)_\n\n## Summary\nNote IDs in collection views render as Org links with the target note's title.\n\n- **`vulpea-ui` collection views** (the named views in `sp-vulpea-ui`): `sp-vulpea-ui-collection-link-ids`, `:around` advice on `vulpea-ui-collection--column-raw-value`. In `meta`, `property` and `fn` cells, a bare note ID shows as its note's title, and `[[ID:..][..]]` text shows as its description, in `org-link` face. RET or a click on the link follows it; RET elsewhere in the row still visits the note. The package source is untouched.\n- **Query tables** (`sp-collection-query-tables`): the `:id` column and meta values that are an ID become `[[id:ID][Title]]` links (Org block writes them; exc and vui show and follow them). A meta cell that holds a link is read-only in vui and exc.\n- Shared helper `sp-org-link-link-ids` in `sp-org-id-link` (next to `sp-org-link-linkify`): looks the ID up in the Vulpea database, strips brackets from the title and lower-cases `[[ID:` so Org can follow it.\n- Docs (`sp-vulpea`, `sp-org-id-link`, `sp-collection-query-tables`) and CHANGELOG updated.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Helpers and the advice run in Emacs 29.3 batch with a stubbed lookup and a stand-in for the `vulpea-ui` function (ID linked, `[[ID:` normalised, plain and empty text kept, title column untouched).\n- [x] `tools/check-tangle.sh`: only the edited modules differ from HEAD, and they match the tangled docs.\n- [ ] Not run: a real `vulpea-ui` collection buffer or the real database. Open `thesis-reading-list` and check the `bib-project`/`pub-author` cells; also an `:id` column in an exc or vui table.\n- Note: the tooltip of a link cell shows the cell text, not the link target (vulpea-ui's own `help-echo` replaces it).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi988xCr8R74bwE6kNd",
